Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Talk ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Opening Talk] Good
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,evening, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:09.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm Rina Honnizumi, the voice of Shizuku Hinomori from MMJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.18,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Good evening, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm Minori Suzuki, the voice of Ena Shinonome from N25.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:15.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:15.89,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:19.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Sekaraji is a radio program brought to you by the cast of the smartphone game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:23.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:26.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The two of us will be your hosts for this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We're the big sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:28.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:29.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Big sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I don't think we've ever had a pair of big sisters together before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:37.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The script says "the two big sisters" on it without asking us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:41.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,but I just thought we were paired up because we get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:46.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I thought it was because Ena and Shizuku are friends,\Nbut it turns out it's the big sister connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.72,0:00:49.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, now that you mention it, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:54.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, sometimes it's hard to tell which one of us is the older sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:57.21,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,or rather, which one of us is the senior in our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:57.61,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:58.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:00:58.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:01.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So, the two of us will be hosting today's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:04.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,By the way, Honnizumi-chan, do you have any siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:05.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm a big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:06.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:07.19,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:09.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have a younger sister.
Comment: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.48,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Are you an older sister in real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:11.62,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I am an older sister in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:12.62,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,There are two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.62,0:01:14.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, two sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:14.77,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.77,0:01:15.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,W-What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:16.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm very much an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.73,0:01:17.23,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.03,0:01:19.53,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:23.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But you have that Shizuku-san vibe, so I just assumed you had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:24.35,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,An older sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:24.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,An older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:24.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:25.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:28.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, but just like Shizuku-chan, I bet your younger sister is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:30.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,who ends up acting like the older sister. That's what I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.56,0:01:32.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel that way too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:33.27,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:35.41,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since we're siblings, I might end up relying on her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:35.63,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:36.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:38.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But you seem to play a lot of older sister roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:42.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true. I really do get cast as the older sister quite often,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:42.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,thankfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:44.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's lovely to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:45.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:52.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, this episode is apparently being released on August 28th.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:57.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It seems like school has already started in some places.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's surprising.
Comment: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:03.30,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:03.30,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Back when I was in elementary or middle school,\Nwe had off until the 31st,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:08.06,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,so around this time I'd be thinking I could still handle the homework...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:11.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I probably thought I could still get away with not doing it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:14.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, on the 28th, you still feel like you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:16.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly. But from the 29th or 30th...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:19.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's when you'd start getting serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:22.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The internal bargaining is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:23.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:27.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But some people have school today, so good luck to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:28.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's Friday today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:29.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:33.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So for those who've already started,\NI guess they have tomorrow off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:34.65,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:36.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, let's do our best with that homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, were you the type to finish it early?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:42.27,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:43.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:44.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:49.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd pile it all up until the very last minute,\Nthinking I was fine, and just end up strangling myself with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:50.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We're the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:50.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:51.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.38,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Every year on the 31st,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:54.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'd be crying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:03:00.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,while writing my independent research project with a certain 24-hour TV show playing in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:57.79,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Why though?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.89,0:02:59.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:07.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,They always tell you\Nthat independent research is something you should plan out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:11.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,but there's a certain charm to writing it at the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:06.73,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Comment: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:08.81,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:08.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:13.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right. That's part of the charm, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:15.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's a memory we can all relate to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:16.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,A memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:19.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well then, let's get started with this episode of Sekaraji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:22.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:30.02,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,program is brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:32.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,HATSUNE MIKU.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:39.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Contact Notebook] Once again, I'm Rina Honnizumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,And I'm Minori Suzuki.
Comment: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.78,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Contact Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.78,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Contact Notebook] We have a question in the contact notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:43.97,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:47.92,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,It's a question from Noguchi-san and 19-san,\Nwho were on the last episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:48.35,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:52.60,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What is something fun you did this summer, or something you're looking forward to?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.22,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Summer is almost over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:57.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Honnizumi-chan, did you get to do anything this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:57.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Honnizumi-chan, did you get to do anything this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:58.31,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:58.31,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.21,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I did so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:03:59.23,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I did so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:03:59.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:03:59.94,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:01.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Is it something you just did recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.94,0:04:01.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Is it something you just did recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:04.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I went on a solo trip! That sounds amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:07.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I went on a solo trip,\Nand for the first time in my life, I traveled by boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:08.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:08.38,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wow, that's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:12.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I went to Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:11.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.02,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:13.50,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,From Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:16.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,From Tokyo, I took the train to Mito,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:21.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,then another train to a place called Oarai,\Nand from there I took a boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,To Tomakomai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:23.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:26.61,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,All the way to Hokkaido! That sounds like so much fun.
Comment: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:27.24,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:27.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:27.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:34.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I boarded the ship around 8:00 PM,\Nand then around 1:00 PM the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:34.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I boarded the ship around 8:00 PM,\Nand then around 1:00 PM the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I arrived in Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So you arrive just after noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:38.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:41.30,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was my first time spending such a long time on a ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:45.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,so I was worried about getting seasick,\Nbut it turns out I'm actually fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.22,0:04:43.18,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm the type that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:46.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:47.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:51.70,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I love looking at the ocean, so I got a room with a view...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:05:00.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And I just spent the whole trip staring at the sea from my room.\NIt was so enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:04:59.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:01.34,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Did you have dinner on the ship too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:02.70,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:05.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! It was a buffet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:08.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since the ship was swaying,\Neveryone was being incredibly careful while carrying their food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:09.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They were.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.70,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I bet they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:15.50,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was interesting to see.\NThere were quite a few solo travelers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:19.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,but because of the timing, there were so many families.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:26.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I kept thinking how fun it must be for kids to have an experience like\Nthat while I watched them and ate my meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:27.42,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was just watching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:28.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:28.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:30.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What did you do once you got to Hokkaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:30.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I went to my lodgings, and...
Comment: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.12,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I went to the Otaru area,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:43.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and the ocean there was just beautiful. Apparently,\NOtaru is considered one of the three most scenic spots in Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:43.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:43.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,だ。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:48.70,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NI stayed at a slightly expensive inn with a view of the beautiful sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:54.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and I just spent the whole time soaking in the hot springs and eating delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:56.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I did whatever I wanted all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:57.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,放題。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:58.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Treating yourself is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:05:59.10,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,大事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:05:59.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:03.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It had been a while since I'd traveled,\Nso I ended up spending a lot of money, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well, that's exactly the kind of time you should use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.34,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,と。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:05.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:09.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Plus, there was no signal on the ship, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:16.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. They had Wi-Fi, but on the ship I took,\Nyou could only use it twice for 30 minutes each.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:12.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:22.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So in a way, it was like a digital detox. I brought books to read,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:32.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and I have a notebook where I write down things about acting and work,\Nso I used that to reflect on myself a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really felt like a solo trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:34.22,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,感じ。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:34.82,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That sounds so fulfilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:35.90,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It seems like you could really focus that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:37.54,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,が。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:38.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I really could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:38.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,た。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:39.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:40.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:41.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,か?
Comment: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.56,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:43.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I love traveling alone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:44.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.85,0:06:45.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:54.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The other day, I suddenly got two days off starting the next day,\Nso I decided to go somewhere with nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:54.87,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:07:00.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I booked it immediately the day before,\Nand this time I went to Kinugawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd been wanting to go to a river for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:08.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,And I had a feeling I'd have a full view of the river from my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:11.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So the only difference was the river versus the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:20.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I wanted to be healed by the water, so I soaked in the hot springs,\Nand I always decide to do a digital detox when I go to an inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:13.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:21.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:24.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I just stayed in the inn and read books the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.73,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The view was so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:29.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,that I spent time on the balcony listening to the murmuring of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:29.62,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We're way too similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:35.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,In how we relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:36.49,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:37.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:44.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Sometimes I just want to see or be near water. I love the ocean too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:42.91,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I want to be near it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:46.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I go to Atami every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:47.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Since it's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:49.02,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I go to Atami often too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:50.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Now I really want to go to Hokkaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's great there.
Comment: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.32,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I want to see the ocean in Hokkaido too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:55.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:55.53,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I think going by ferry is a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:06.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,If you combine the cost of a flight and a hotel,\Ngoing by ferry might even be a bit cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:07:59.23,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:06.25,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:12.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,As long as you don't get seasick,\NI think it's perfect for people who love the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I've heard Oarai is nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:14.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:19.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was really just there to catch the ferry, but the air was so fresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:24.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,and even though it was brief,\Nit had just stopped raining so there was a rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:24.23,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:30.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The sky was so clear and lovely,\Nso I'd love to actually go sightseeing in Oarai next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:27.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That sounds amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:35.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,There were definitely a lot of people heading toward Oarai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:34.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I hear there are a lot of nice traditional inns there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, the list of places I want to go just keeps growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:39.93,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's great, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:41.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It turns out we both had some summer memories after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:44.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:44.89,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Comment: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:52.04,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:52.04,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Listener Mail] All right, then.\NLet's move on and introduce some of the listener mail we've received.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:50.69,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:52.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:53.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Before we get to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:09:02.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,we'll need to leave a comment in the contact notebook for the next pair of hosts during the ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:04.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since that's in the ending, let's start thinking of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:04.97,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:10.80,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get back to it. This first one is from Radio name: 4B.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:11.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Like the pencil lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.02,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They must like the dark ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:15.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:19.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-more, kon-niigo."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:20.18,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:20.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:22.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:25.40,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I just realized I haven't eaten any shaved ice yet this year."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:29.76,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It's been so hot out that I haven't felt like going outside at all, so I think that's why."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:30.33,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:34.96,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"There's a festival at the end of the month, so I'm planning to go and eat some there."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.96,0:09:37.08,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Have you two eaten any shaved ice yet?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.12,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder if\Nthat festival is happening right around the time this episode airs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:41.65,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:43.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I wonder if they got to eat some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:45.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Man, that sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:46.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Have you had any?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I don't think I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:49.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Comment: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.04,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten any.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:57.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see photos of these super photogenic shaved ice treats on social media all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:10:01.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,but I've never actually said, "I want to go to this shop."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.21,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:09:58.81,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:02.70,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:03.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I do admire them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:04.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:09.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Some people really go around to all these different shaved ice shops,\Nand...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:08.33,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,They do, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:17.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's not just the usual strawberry syrup. Apparently,\Nthey have things like pumpkin cream or even vegetable-based ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:17.97,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:18.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That sounds delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:19.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:22.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,People who love it will even eat it in the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Shaved ice in the winter sounds nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:24.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:26.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's like eating ice cream in a warm room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:27.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I think I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.85,0:10:28.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:29.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I should give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:29.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Did you go to any festivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:32.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I didn't go to any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:36.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I haven't even stumbled across one by accident this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:37.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:43.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I actually went to a fireworks festival,\Nso I've been enjoying summer to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:40.61,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That sounds like so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:47.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But even then, I just looked at the shaved ice and didn't eat any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:50.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Ah, right, they have the food stalls and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:11:00.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But when I went to Hokkaido like I mentioned earlier,\NI did eat that famous treat where they put soft serve on a melon.
Comment: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:01.88,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:01.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So, about ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:02.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:06.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, even at the airport on the way back—I flew home,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:12.55,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,by the way— New Chitose Airport has so many shops selling soft-serve ice cream,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.55,0:11:16.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,so I picked out one really delicious one to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were that many.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:18.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,There are tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Man, I wouldn't be able to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:20.98,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So, that's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:22.67,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Now I want some shaved ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:24.91,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:27.62,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:30.94,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Our next piece of listener mail is from Hogu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:28.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:32.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:32.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:35.88,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:36.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:43.40,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"If this mail is being read, I'm probably in the middle of desperately finishing my summer homework."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:51.40,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I finished the time-consuming stuff like my independent research project early with my parents, but I'm sure I still haven't finished my workbooks."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:49.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, how responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:53.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The word 'workbooks' sounds so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:58.26,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Are you two the type to get things done ahead of time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:01.24,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Also, what were you like back when you were students?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:02.50,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,This is a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:05.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:15.72,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:15.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I think you could tell from the opening talk,\Nbut back in my student days, I was a mess who put everything off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:09.53,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.17,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:13.61,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:23.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But I did have the habit of turning in my homework,\Nso I always made the deadlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:26.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad that carried over into adulthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:27.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You have to keep that part together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:28.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:29.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:32.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,If you asked if I'm doing it perfectly, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:41.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I have this side of me that's a bit sly.\NYou know how the first class for each subject...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,can be at different times?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.81,0:12:43.31,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I would stretch it out until the very last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I also used the "I forgot it" excuse a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:51.15,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:55.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'd say, "I did it, but I left it at home."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:56.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I managed to get by somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well, as long as it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:01.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Since you're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.52,0:13:06.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got by... but really, it's thanks to all the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:06.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,How are you now that you're an adult?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:11.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Even as an adult, I'm still doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:16.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Every now and then, I'm right at the limit. We have deadlines, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:22.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Please return this questionnaire by this date," or "Reply by this time."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:25.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:26.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Comment: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:26.39,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:26.39,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:27.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.05,0:13:27.55,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:31.46,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm always so grateful to my manager. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,My manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:33.15,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:33.90,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That does happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:34.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,How about you, Suzuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:35.38,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,On that front.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:38.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,For me, I can work hard once I flip the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:46.22,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I tend to get things done early, but once that switch turns off,\NI really start putting everything off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:47.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That work switch is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.26,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It would be nice if that switch just stayed on all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:51.45,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's tough, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:53.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,My off-switch is just too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:54.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Good luck with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:03.78,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Listener Mail] Okay,\Nnext we have one from Radio name: Mutsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:08.08,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello to Rina Honnizumi-san and Minori Suzuki-san. Kon-more, kon-niigo."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.27,0:14:08.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Kon-niigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:09.63,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-niigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:10.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:17.88,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I was recently grinding a ProSeka event, and I had Sekaraji playing the whole time I was doing laps."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:18.27,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:24.28,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The cast's talk was so funny and soothing that the time just flew by."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:28.12,Rina Honnizumi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Do you two have anything that helps you get work done?"
Comment: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:30.64,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:30.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's so skillful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right? Because if they're grinding for items,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:37.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,it means they're listening to us talk while playing a rhythm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:38.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They're like Prince Shotoku, multitasking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:40.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:40.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:42.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I bet they've memorized the songs by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:43.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:47.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful they've played the charts enough to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:45.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:50.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what else...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:51.29,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,helps things...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:51.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,move along?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:59.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I often have a radio show or a stream playing when I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.28,0:14:59.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Really? You listen to people talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:02.78,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,it helps me feel relaxed enough to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.91,0:15:05.41,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:06.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But that's not really 'work,' is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:09.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right. That's for sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:19.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,For actual work,\NI might put on one of those 'BGM for work' videos on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:14.25,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Do you play anything when you're reading a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:23.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,No, I don't play anything when I read.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:28.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The sounds would just get mixed in.
Comment: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:30.00,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:30.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:32.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, information is a strange thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.65,0:15:31.15,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,For me, it's silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:34.83,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:37.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Even when I'm checking my work...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Even when checking work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:44.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's either silence or background music,\Nbut I don't play it very loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's just barely audible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:48.78,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But I think I generally prefer silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:51.15,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:55.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I think I prefer silence when I'm trying to absorb a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:56.31,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:15:57.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:59.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,What about when you're reading manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:07.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I usually end up playing some kind of music.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:01.93,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:08.07,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:16.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Also, when I'm reading a book,\NI often play Western music or BGM that fits the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:14.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:17.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:21.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The other day, I was reading a book set in the Mayan civilization...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You read such a variety of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:24.30,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:33.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So I searched for free music that sounded like the Mayan civilization,\Nand things actually came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:28.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:33.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:34.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Comment: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.96,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Hearing that really gets me in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:37.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:38.79,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I feel like it helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:39.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:41.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Like, if it's an action scene, I'll listen to intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:42.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:43.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,...sounds and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:47.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Or if it's set by the sea, I'll listen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:52.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,...ambient ocean sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:51.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:53.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:54.63,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Do you have a specific type of book you take on trips?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:08.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, when I travel, I try to bring books I've already started.\NI usually have a few going at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:04.31,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:09.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:18.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,My mood changes, so I might want one today but not another.\NI read all sorts of genres, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:13.85,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:17.93,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,When you go on a trip, you want to be selective, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:21.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.56,0:17:22.98,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Because you want to pack light.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:23.13,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:29.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So if I start reading and realize I'm not in the mood for it,\NI really regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:29.35,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:35.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So I'll read a bit first and then bring the one I'm currently in the mood for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.42,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:37.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:38.46,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Really impressive.
Comment: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:40.30,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:40.30,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:39.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:41.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What's the word for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:42.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's like a professional... what do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:46.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Like someone\Nwho picks the perfect drink for a person based on their mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What was that term again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:48.15,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:50.74,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, not a meister, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:53.46,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That kind of professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:53.05,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,A professional, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:54.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I can't think of the word either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:56.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Like, "This is the one for you today."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:57.19,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:59.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, like a professional for books.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:00.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:04.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm always looking for things that match my current state of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:05.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:09.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I really respect people who can read books like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:11.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Books really are something, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:17.16,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, thank you so much, Mutsuki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.16,0:18:19.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's all for this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:23.96,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,We're waiting for more questions and themes you'd like to ask the ProSeka cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:24.72,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.28,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song ===
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:28.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Song] With that, let's play a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:28.75,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:38.07,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So, this song features Shizuku as the lead,\Nand I'd be happy if you could listen to it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:45.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,while feeling the way the weather in your heart changes along with the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:31.91,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:35.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:46.99,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:06.29,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,(Click)
Comment: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:14.16,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:14.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Theme Mail] For this episode,\Nwe asked for mail on this theme:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:17.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,"Things I'm looking forward to in autumn."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,(Laughter)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:19.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:20.33,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:20.87,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:26.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The late summer heat is still lingering,\Nbut autumn will be here before we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:30.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So, we asked everyone to send in what they're looking forward to this fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:33.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Let's get right into the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.32,0:21:33.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:34.91,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:35.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:37.72,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,This is from Radio name: Agetate no Potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:38.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:39.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:43.20,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:43.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:47.00,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What I'm looking forward to this autumn is the maple leaves."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.56,0:21:48.16,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The autumn colors."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:51.64,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm going to Kyoto in September to see the autumn foliage."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:59.30,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I usually go to Kyoto in the summer, so this is my first time going in the fall. After seeing photos of the colors at places like Kiyomizu-dera,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:03.78,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I thought they looked so beautiful,\Nand I'm really excited to go see them for myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:04.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, lovely.
Comment: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:06.04,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:06.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Have you ever been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:06.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I have, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've been many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:10.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I even used to go by myself back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:13.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I haven't really been able to go these past few years, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:13.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:25.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I usually go around summer, like September,\Nso I've never been when the autumn leaves are in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.39,0:22:19.89,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:26.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:28.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's hard to time it right, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:29.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:32.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It depends so much on the weather that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:33.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:35.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But it sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:35.47,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.16,0:22:43.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I heard it's supposed to be a bit warmer in the west this year,\Nso the timing might shift around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:44.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I wonder how it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:44.90,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:50.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But even if the maples haven't changed color yet,\Nthe greenery is still beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.87,0:22:51.37,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:54.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if Potato-san will get to see them or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.28,0:23:00.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well, even if they don't see them this year,\NI'm sure the scenery will still be wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:01.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.12,0:23:03.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:04.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Kyoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.40,0:23:07.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I don't know how old they are, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.65,0:23:08.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:09.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It sounds so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:11.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's lovely, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:11.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:23:12.21,0:23:12.71,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.21,0:23:12.71,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:13.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.84,0:23:17.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,All right, let's keep moving through these.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.71,0:23:18.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.36,0:23:22.52,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Next, we have one from Radio name: Yusuke Enaoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:24.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:25.72,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Thank you for all you do."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.20,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-niigo."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:30.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:33.48,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"This is the first time I've sent in listener mail."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.23,0:23:33.73,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:34.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:35.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Everyone's so sophisticated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.66,0:23:40.24,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What I look forward to in autumn is going for walks while feeling the cool breeze."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:41.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right? That's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.31,0:23:41.81,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:44.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Everyone has such nice ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:44.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:55.28,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I don't handle heat very well, so I don't feel like going out in summer unless I have to, but once autumn comes and it gets cooler, I go for walks quite often."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.67,0:23:51.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:24:01.60,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Seeing the autumn leaves and the sunsets during those walks is very healing."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.39,0:24:01.89,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.60,0:24:07.44,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Last year, the period where it actually felt cool was so short\Nthat I didn't get to walk much,"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.07,0:24:05.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:10.08,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"so I hope I can go for lots of walks this year."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.37,0:24:10.87,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:13.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I love going for walks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.97,0:24:13.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:20.30,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I try to walk as much as I can normally,\Nbut yeah, summer is definitely tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.99,0:24:20.49,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah."
Comment: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:21.36,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:21.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:22.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm not good with the heat either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.12,0:24:23.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.80,0:24:26.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You can still get heatstroke even if you're careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.85,0:24:27.35,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:33.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it getting cooler and cooler from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:31.23,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.44,0:24:36.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The sun setting earlier is also...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:38.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It gets pretty emotional, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.68,0:24:39.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:41.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I think things will start changing soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.16,0:24:42.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Once we hit September, it really shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.80,0:24:44.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it feels like it'll happen fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.24,0:24:44.74,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.76,0:24:45.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.60,0:24:47.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Even the sound of the insects...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.60,0:24:49.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The way they chirp will change too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.29,0:24:49.79,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.04,0:24:50.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:52.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Man, everyone's ideas are so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:53.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.80,0:24:54.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's very chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:54.93,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Totally chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:57.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, shall we keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.52,0:24:59.98,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Alright, next is from Popopo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:01.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.88,0:25:04.72,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-niigo."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.84,0:25:06.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.20,0:25:09.56,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What I'm looking forward to this autumn is the ProSeka Kanshasai."
Comment: 0,0:25:09.65,0:25:10.15,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.65,0:25:10.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:15.18,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Since all four members of MMJ will be together for the first time at this year's Kanshasai,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:18.40,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm really looking forward to seeing what kind of performance it will be."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.61,0:25:19.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.36,0:25:20.40,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you for the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:24.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right, like the MMJ Symphony and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.87,0:25:22.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:24.17,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:29.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We've had a few chances for all four of us to be together on livestreams and things,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.98,0:25:32.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,but this will be the first time for a Kanshasai.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.97,0:25:31.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.68,0:25:33.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.48,0:25:34.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Apparently so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:37.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So I'll get to see all four of you together in person for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.20,0:25:39.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I've seen photos, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.79,0:25:40.29,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.48,0:25:41.14,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:46.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But everyone in MMJ has such incredible passion for being part of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:51.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I mean, everyone does,\Nbut there's this feeling of "we're definitely going to do this!"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:47.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:52.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.40,0:25:54.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like, their drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:55.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.52,0:25:56.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's just amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:57.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm so glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:03.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's like you can feel this sense of "we're going to make this happen as four, no matter what."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.64,0:26:06.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I can really feel that from the outside, and it's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.61,0:26:06.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.96,0:26:08.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'll have to tell the other three.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.99,0:26:08.49,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no!
Comment: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.24,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:10.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I think it's really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.08,0:26:12.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Even the rehearsals and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:15.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've already started by the time this airs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.44,0:26:17.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:19.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, because you have to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:24.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. N25 doesn't really dance much,\Nor rather, that's just not our style,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.45,0:26:20.95,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:26.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So it really is different for every unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.76,0:26:27.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It is, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:32.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's the same for other teams,\Nbut MMJ dances especially hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.48,0:26:34.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right, and the choreography every time...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.88,0:26:41.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,They give us full routines, and we sing along too.\NUsually, about a month...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.37,0:26:39.87,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:45.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel like we start about a month before the actual performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.38,0:26:45.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You do a lot of practicing on your own too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:49.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I do a ton of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:55.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel like I just need to get the repetitions in by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.37,0:26:53.87,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:55.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.68,0:26:57.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's pretty nerve-wracking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:26:58.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:04.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Plus, they're idols, and the characters keep growing as idols too,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.91,0:27:01.41,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.76,0:27:08.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So as MMJ, you really feel like you have to give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.28,0:27:08.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It really gets you fired up,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:09.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:11.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.21,0:27:11.71,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:12.96,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.54,0:27:12.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what songs they'll sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.20,0:27:15.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right? Please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.76,0:27:17.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,N25 will have all four members together this year too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.84,0:27:18.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:22.30,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Last year was the first time...\Nwell, we were all together for the Symphony,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:25.74,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,but last year's Kanshasai was the first time we were all there together,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.74,0:27:26.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,and it really felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.83,0:27:22.33,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.47,0:27:24.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.98,0:27:33.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,How do I put it? Singing as a trio or a duo is fun, of course, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.04,0:27:39.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,When all four of us are together, singing the original vocal parts...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.71,0:27:39.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:44.97,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's like I can reaffirm for myself\Nthat the four of us really are one unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.97,0:27:48.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It feels like the puzzle pieces finally fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.43,0:27:45.93,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.28,0:27:49.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like they just click into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:55.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I really felt last year\Nthat Ena finally becomes Ena when we're all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.85,0:27:52.35,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.01,0:27:55.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:56.55,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.27,0:27:56.77,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.55,0:28:03.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,MMJ was all together for the Symphony too,\Nand you even danced a bit. Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.07,0:27:58.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.52,0:28:02.28,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It'll be even more...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.33,0:28:04.83,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:05.52,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.52,0:28:06.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:07.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:09.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:09.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,This year as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.84,0:28:10.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I definitely will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.60,0:28:13.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.31,0:28:11.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:28:13.16,0:28:15.76,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.16,0:28:15.76,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Next, we have one from Suirenka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.84,0:28:16.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.92,0:28:17.54,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.54,0:28:18.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Everyone is so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.98,0:28:21.12,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Honnizumi-san, Suzuki-san, kon-more kon-niigo."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:22.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-more kon-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.75,0:28:23.25,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.96,0:28:28.32,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I love Ena and Mizuki from N25, and Shizuku-sama from MMJ."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.44,0:28:29.36,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.64,0:28:31.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You just want to add that "-sama" to her name, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.24,0:28:35.56,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"When I heard you two would be appearing, I decided to write in for the first time."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.55,0:28:36.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:36.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:39.72,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"There are two things I'm looking forward to this autumn."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.65,0:28:40.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.24,0:28:45.56,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"First is the ProSeka Unit Fan Meeting: 25-ji, Nightcord de. in Oita."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.57,0:28:46.07,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:51.64,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Back in high school, N25's songs supported me through the stress of entrance exams, and I passed."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.96,0:28:53.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.20,0:28:55.24,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I started living on my own this spring."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.21,0:28:55.71,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.08,0:28:59.52,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Now my wish has come true, and I can attend my first fan meeting."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.51,0:29:00.01,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.04,0:29:03.12,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It feels like a dream to be able to meet the cast members I love so much."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.12,0:29:05.96,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I want to enjoy it to the fullest as a reward to myself."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.97,0:29:06.47,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.76,0:29:07.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.92,0:29:11.72,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Second is my first cultural festival at university."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:11.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.72,0:29:16.00,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Until high school, I always had studying in the back of my mind, but..."
Comment: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.92,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.92,Minori Suzuki,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm so excited to enjoy this year to the fullest."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.84,0:29:22.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Aww, I really hope they have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.20,0:29:22.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.12,0:29:25.22,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wait, they're a college student living alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.22,0:29:26.10,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.10,0:29:27.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Has it been about four months now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.00,0:29:28.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Has it been that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:29.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's almost been three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.29,0:29:30.79,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.03,0:29:31.53,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.00,0:29:34.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,A new environment can be so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.77,0:29:35.27,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:39.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Man, getting listener mail like this really makes me feel like I need to work harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.20,0:29:43.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,When I think about how some people are coming to see us as a reward for their hard work...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.56,0:29:44.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.24,0:29:44.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It really motivates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.59,0:29:46.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.12,0:29:50.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I just hope we can be a wonderful reward for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.93,0:29:48.43,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.64,0:29:51.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's actually really touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.44,0:29:56.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Imagine getting to meet the people you've been listening to,\Nwho've been supporting you emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.79,0:29:55.29,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.88,0:29:57.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:00.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:02.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, it's in Oita.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:04.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Is it the week after this radio episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:11.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Since I'm going too, and it's my first time in Oita,\NI'm really looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:06.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.53,0:30:08.03,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.01,0:30:10.51,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Comment: 0,0:30:11.52,0:30:13.24,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.52,0:30:13.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I hope you get to eat some delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.17,0:30:13.67,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.96,0:30:15.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'll let me eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.31,0:30:16.81,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.07,0:30:17.57,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.75,0:30:18.26,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.26,0:30:19.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I heard there's going to be a relay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.87,0:30:20.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.44,0:30:21.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:27.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,If N25 works hard, maybe that becomes the prize for us in MMJ?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.95,0:30:24.45,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.69,0:30:26.19,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.65,0:30:28.38,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.38,0:30:29.12,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.12,0:30:33.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It probably goes around in a cycle, so... yeah, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.92,0:30:31.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, since it'll come full circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:34.44,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.44,0:30:34.94,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.84,0:30:35.56,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,...Oita has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:36.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.84,0:30:40.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,The venue is actually called Iichiko Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:40.62,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.97,0:30:41.47,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Shochu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.20,0:30:43.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, it's so shochu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:44.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:45.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, will I be able to drink some?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.56,0:30:47.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Well, there's a chance it's not related to that at all, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.85,0:30:48.35,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.40,0:30:49.68,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But if I can drink, that would be fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.75,0:30:50.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Comment: 0,0:30:50.28,0:30:53.88,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.28,0:30:53.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But I don't really see the MMJ members... well,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.56,0:30:57.96,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I can imagine Hon-chan and Yoshioka-san drinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:01.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,but I can't really picture the two of you doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.79,0:31:02.29,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.08,0:31:05.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What do you like to drink when you're eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.88,0:31:06.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ooh, what would I like?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.92,0:31:07.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oolong tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.53,0:31:08.03,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oolong tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.44,0:31:10.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I can definitely see you drinking tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.04,0:31:13.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see. Then you'd probably enjoy Oita's tea and shochu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:12.91,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:15.11,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'd be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.92,0:31:16.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,With those drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.80,0:31:17.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.64,0:31:18.51,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.51,0:31:19.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.32,0:31:23.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,They also mentioned a school festival, so I hope they have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.60,0:31:22.48,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh right, the school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.48,0:31:25.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what they'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.56,0:31:29.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,University festivals are pretty free, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.40,0:31:31.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe they're more flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:32.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Like you can do whatever you want, or how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.90,0:31:33.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.40,0:31:35.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Compared to high school or middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:37.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, because you do it all yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.28,0:31:38.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,There's that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.04,0:31:42.32,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Some universities even invite voice actors for talk shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.32,0:31:44.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Since you can do things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.47,0:31:43.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:47.40,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You can really do a lot more on your own.
Comment: 0,0:31:45.71,0:31:46.21,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.71,0:31:46.21,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.41,0:31:47.91,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:48.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.00,0:31:50.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes, please enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.55,0:31:51.05,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.60,0:31:52.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.76,0:31:53.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.20,0:31:57.28,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Well, that's all for the messages we're introducing this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.05,0:31:57.55,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.28,0:31:59.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:31:59.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.12,0:32:03.52,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Today, we shared messages based on the theme "Things I'm Looking Forward to in Autumn."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:05.20,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you all for your submissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.20,0:32:05.70,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.92,0:32:19.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:34.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We'll keep things moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.72,0:32:36.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Ending] And now, it's time for the Sekaraji ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:36.95,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.95,0:32:39.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We're always waiting for your submissions here on the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.44,0:32:39.99,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Please write in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.99,0:32:43.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The email address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.10,0:32:45.95,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.95,0:32:48.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,For more details, please check the official ProSeka X account.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.72,0:32:49.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.44,0:32:51.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We'd appreciate it\Nif you could send in your emails as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.80,0:32:52.33,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.33,0:32:53.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,And don't forget to include your Radio name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:54.64,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Make sure it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.74,0:32:55.30,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.72,0:32:59.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The next episode is also scheduled to be a unit shuffle.
Comment: 0,0:32:58.90,0:32:59.86,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.90,0:32:59.86,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.00,0:32:59.50,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.00,0:33:01.70,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Ending] So,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:08.44,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,we need to leave a question in the contact notebook for the next pair of hosts,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.34,0:33:07.14,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:11.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,and there's something I'd really like to ask them about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.58,0:33:10.34,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:11.98,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:12.54,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I have one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:13.58,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Please, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.18,0:33:13.94,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:17.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,"What is the biggest thing you've ever forgotten in your life?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.32,0:33:17.82,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.62,0:33:18.18,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.18,0:33:19.01,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.01,0:33:21.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well, we were just talking about travel again,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.60,0:33:30.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,and I was telling you how I've left for Hokkaido multiple times\Nwhile forgetting really important things...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.38,0:33:30.30,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.24,0:33:31.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So, I decided to go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:33.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,If they have a story like that, I'd love to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:33.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's a good topic. Do you have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.57,0:33:34.07,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:34.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Does anything come to mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.76,0:33:37.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I don't really see the MMJ members as the type to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:36.74,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Nothing immediately, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.74,0:33:39.15,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.40,0:33:41.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I have this image of Hon-chan and Yoshioka-san being very... Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.15,0:33:39.88,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.00,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I forgot my iPad once.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.20,0:33:45.07,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's rough. You wouldn't be able to check your scripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.72,0:33:42.40,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I left it at the studio.
Comment: 0,0:33:42.40,0:33:45.20,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.40,0:33:45.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's true\Nthat people don't really have a clear image of us two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.07,0:33:45.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.20,0:33:45.78,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:46.26,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.78,0:33:47.37,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was so relieved when we finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.37,0:33:50.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,but after saying "Good job today," I realized my bag felt way too light...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.92,0:33:49.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,What do you think they'd like to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.76,0:33:51.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, was it Oolong tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:51.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Oolong tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.36,0:33:53.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Then I thought, oh, it's green tea too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.78,0:33:52.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:54.98,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I can totally see them drinking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.88,0:33:57.36,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I see, so Oita tea and shochu, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.98,0:33:56.66,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,During the ProSeka broadcast...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.66,0:33:58.76,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I was so happy at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.36,0:33:57.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,They look like they could handle their drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:34:00.46,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You know how we borrow microphones?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.76,0:34:00.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,For drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.28,0:34:00.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.46,0:34:01.18,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.18,0:34:02.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I think I might have accidentally taken it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.44,0:34:02.42,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:06.92,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Since we have friends there, and there's even a school festival,\NI want everyone to have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.52,0:34:03.02,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.44,0:34:06.32,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's right, the school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.32,0:34:06.82,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:08.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I actually went home with the lapel mic still attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.32,0:34:09.08,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what they'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.08,0:34:09.58,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.40,0:34:12.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,The makeup artist noticed halfway through and called me.\NI wonder if college is pretty free like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:15.90,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I rushed back and was able to return it.
Comment: 0,0:34:13.24,0:34:14.84,Rina Honnizumi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.24,0:34:14.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right, it's much more glamorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.84,0:34:16.64,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's like you can do whatever you want, or how should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.90,0:34:17.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,That's how it was, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.08,0:34:18.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You really can't let your guard down in high school,\Nunlike middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.48,0:34:19.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You feel a sense of relief once it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.59,0:34:19.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:20.92,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, doing it yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.72,0:34:20.37,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,When it ends...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.37,0:34:21.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Even when I went back to my hometown...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.88,0:34:26.16,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,There are universities in Aichi\Nthat invite voice actors for talk shows, so I'd go back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:24.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.16,0:34:27.43,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You can even do things like that without your wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.31,0:34:27.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.43,0:34:28.08,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.08,0:34:29.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Since you're doing it yourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:29.60,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.28,0:34:31.00,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,You can do all sorts of things with your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:30.10,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.00,0:34:32.86,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,So have fun with those payments!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.25,0:34:31.97,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.97,0:34:32.84,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.84,0:34:34.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, please have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.86,0:34:34.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I could go because the tickets were on my credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.72,0:34:35.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yes, since I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.48,0:34:36.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,bought them online in advance, I could still go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.80,0:34:38.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But it was definitely a close call!
Comment: 0,0:34:38.84,0:34:41.12,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.84,0:34:41.12,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's all for the submissions this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:41.20,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, so you realized that after you got to Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.12,0:34:42.96,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you, every... wait, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.20,0:34:41.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,When did you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.96,0:34:48.48,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I was on the Shinkansen heading from Tokyo to Aichi,\Nand I was rummaging through my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.24,0:34:43.76,Rina Honnizumi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.48,0:34:48.99,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Huh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.99,0:34:49.88,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,"Wait, I don't have my wallet."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:52.94,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But I was already on the train, so I just had to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.94,0:34:53.47,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.44,0:34:57.24,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I think I would've been doomed if my phone battery had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.19,0:34:56.69,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.32,0:34:59.36,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have been able to get through the ticket gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.69,0:35:00.23,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Man, my heart was pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.23,0:35:01.80,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It was such a scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.29,0:35:02.79,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.84,0:35:05.04,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to seeing what comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:05.80,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.27,0:35:06.77,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.88,0:35:08.04,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Comment: 0,0:35:08.36,0:35:14.60,Minori Suzuki,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.36,0:35:14.60,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,[CORNER: Ending] And with that, it's already time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.55,0:35:11.05,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.91,0:35:12.41,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.31,0:35:13.81,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.72,0:35:15.24,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.20,0:35:19.84,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,I guess we'll see each other again at the fan festa or a fan meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.37,0:35:18.87,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.00,0:35:22.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,I feel like I didn't really manage to talk like a proper big sister today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.16,0:35:24.20,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Well, you did forget your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.40,0:35:24.96,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.12,0:35:25.66,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Now that you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.66,0:35:27.72,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,But what does it even mean to be "big sister-like"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:29.56,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.57,0:35:30.07,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.08,0:35:32.12,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,We'd have to start by defining that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.23,0:35:32.78,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We really would.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.78,0:35:34.28,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,We'd need a whole hour for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.44,0:35:36.16,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,But it's fine to have a big sister who's a bit scatterbrained,\Nisn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.18,0:35:36.68,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.68,0:35:37.18,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.09,0:35:37.59,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.08,0:35:38.76,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.00,0:35:39.52,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.25,0:35:40.75,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:46.20,Minori Suzuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Well, your hosts for today were Rina Honnizumi and Minori Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.95,0:35:46.45,Rina Honnizumi,host,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.20,0:35:46.95,Minori Suzuki,host,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.16,0:35:56.96,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,This program was brought to you by Project SEKAI Colorful Stage! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.96,0:35:59.28,Default,host_meta,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku.
